{"id":"9d782aac0c1a67b9","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-vper-lattice-operations.md","title":"值相容PER的交与生成上确界","display":"df-vper-lattice-operations — 值相容PER的交与生成上确界","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-vper-lattice-operations","aliases":["72-df-vper-lattice-operations"],"display":"df-vper-lattice-operations — 值相容PER的交与生成上确界","depends_on":["[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X PER semantics print739–750/PDF751–762; local complete-lattice construction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-vper-lattice-operations"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-vper-lattice-operations</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-vper-lattice-operations — 值相容PER的交与生成上确界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X PER semantics print739–750/PDF751–762; local complete-lattice construction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d79ea25f75d5218c\" href=\"?note=d79ea25f75d5218c\" title=\"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per\">72-df-evaluation-respecting-per</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VPER}\">\\(\\operatorname{VPER}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)\\)</span> 可为空，R为T²上的关系。交集明确相对于 T²，不使用未限定的空族交。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K:=\\{\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in T^2:\\forall R\\in\\mathcal K\\ (tRu)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K:=\\{\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in T^2:\\forall R\\in\\mathcal K\\ (tRu)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K:=\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\n\\{R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e):\\bigcup\\mathcal K\\subseteq R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K:=\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\n\\{R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e):\\bigcup\\mathcal K\\subseteq R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\varnothing=T^2,\\qquad\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\varnothing=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\varnothing=T^2,\\qquad\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\varnothing=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对称、传递及 Kleene 相等饱和都由逐关系交保持。T²为上界，所以生成上确界所用的族非空。上确界一般要补齐传递和饱和信息，不能直接定义为任意关系族的并。这里只讨论成员 PER 的包含序，不替代书中保持旧纤维完全相同的类型系统扩张次序。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-evaluation-respecting-per","status":"resolved","id":"d79ea25f75d5218c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-evaluation-respecting-per]] 的 $\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$ 与 $\\operatorname{VPER}$；$\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$ 可为空，R为T²上的关系。交集明确相对于 T²，不使用未限定的空族交。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak e=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VPER}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K:=\\{\\langle t,u\\rangle\\in T^2:\\forall R\\in\\mathcal K\\ (tRu)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\mathcal K:=\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\n\\{R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e):\\bigcup\\mathcal K\\subseteq R\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e}\\varnothing=T^2,\\qquad\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}\\varnothing=\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1753,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-104","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"68a80369b215cba0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"关系、值相容性及生成上确界取 [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]]。$T:=\\{0,1,2\\}$，$\\Downarrow:=\\{\\langle t,t\\rangle:t\\in T\\}$，$\\mathfrak e:=\\langle T,\\Downarrow\\rangle$。R、S由下式给出。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-100","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"X章新增11项：[[72-df-system-f-church-numerals]] · [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]] · [[72-ex-per-union-not-transitive]] · [[72-ex-value-per-can-contain-divergence]] · [[72-thm-dependent-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-disjoint-sum-per-quotient]] · [[72-thm-preevaluation-live-support]] · [[72-thm-system-f-church-iteration]] · [[72-thm-system-f-empty-type]] · [[72-thm-vper-directed-union]] · [[72-thm-vper-lattice-bounds]]"},{"id":"015ee65edd2df406","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,\\operatorname{VPER},\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}$ 取 [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]]；$\\varnothing\\ne\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，且 $\\forall R,S\\in\\mathcal K\\ \\exists U\\in\\mathcal K\\ (R\\cup S\\subseteq U)$。"},{"id":"998b9421ae6cd8b3","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak e,\\operatorname{VPER},\\bigwedge_{\\mathfrak e},\\bigvee_{\\mathfrak e}$ 取 [[72-df-vper-lattice-operations]]；$\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$，$R\\in\\operatorname{VPER}(\\mathfrak e)$。"}],"outgoing":["d79ea25f75d5218c"]}